OL,3,GNEWSACelebrations begin for nine-day
OL,4,AHindu festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FCelebrations for a nine-day Hindu
OL,7,Ffestival of dancing are set to get
OL,8,Funderway across Manchester.
OL,10,FNavratri, which runs until 20 October,
OL,11,Fcelebrates Durga, the mother goddess
OL,12,Fwho carries weapons in her arms, and
OL,13,Fmarks her nine-day battle with evil
OL,14,Fdemon Mahishasura.
OL,16,FOne of the most important celebrations
OL,17,Fin the Hindu calendar, communities
OL,18,Facross the North West will celebrate
OL,19,Fwith dancing, gift-giving, light, and
OL,20,Ffood, including in Oldham which is
OL,21,Fhosting free events throughout the
OL,22,Fperiod.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
